# NetworkWalks Cybersecurity Internship – Week 2 Final Report

## Project Overview
This repository contains my Week 2 Final Penetration Testing Report for the NetworkWalks Cybersecurity Internship.

The report documents the practical activities completed across two project modules:

- **W2-PM1 – Footprinting:** Information gathering and reconnaissance using WHOIS, WhatWeb, NSLOOKUP, cURL, WAFW00F and DNSRecon.
- **W2-PM5 – Network Scanning:** Local network discovery, host identification, scan analysis and network topology visualisation using Zenmap (Nmap).

## Objectives
- Understand the footprinting and reconnaissance process.
- Practise using relevant information-gathering tools.
- Identify active hosts within an authorised local network.
- Analyse network scan results.
- Document findings and practical evidence professionally.

